one seems to be interested in knowing the truth.","tagline":"The hidden legend of the Barcelona subway."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Un misterio que durante años ha sacudido a la estación de Metro de Rocafort en Barcelona entra de lleno en la vida de Laura (Natalia Azahara) cuando empieza a trabajar en esta vieja y tranquila parada. No tardará en descubrir una leyenda que la empezará a perseguir: allí ha muerto mucha gente en extrañas circunstancias. Laura, decidida a descubrir la verdad, pedirá ayuda a Román (Javier Gutiérrez), un curtido expolicía que alberga sus propios demonios relacionados con el caso. Lo que sea que ocurre en la estación maldita sigue sucediendo a día de hoy. Irá a por ella, y a por todos los que la rodean."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rHd3FRzflvXi4whBotsn66ZRm20.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rHd3FRzflvXi4whBotsn66ZRm20.png","language":"es","width":898,"height":246},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7OiJqSaIhSKC51oMYryh3UAmKtE.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7OiJqSaIhSKC51oMYryh3UAmKtE.png","language":"es","width":225,"height":59}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7huQtPNfWg4s66wWmQPhpjGmfiY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7huQtPNfWg4s66wWmQPhpjGmfiY.jpg","language":"it","width":1335,"height":2000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ske6eNJYVFhcCm2fYg6jlphA7gQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ske6eNJYVFhcCm2fYg6jlphA7gQ.jpg","language":"it","width":1335,"height":2000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oY6KfZgplGCA4WszBgd5WV2VOKj.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oY6KfZgplGCA4WszBgd5WV2VOKj.jpg","language":"en","width":1080,"height":1600},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cByBSxec9J5IMb3u9tNMtkLPnWc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cByBSxec9J5